<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a> <span>›</span> <a href="/en/blog">Blog</a> <span>›</span> <span>ITIN</span></div><h1>How Undocumented Individuals Can Obtain an ITIN</h1></div></section>
